      "v": 2,
      "zh": "我的心平稳安静，好像断过奶的孩子在他母亲的怀中；我的心在我里面真像断过奶的孩子。",
      "en": "Indeed,[NOTE:1] I have calmed and quieted myself[NOTE:2] like a weaned child with its mother;[NOTE:3] I am content like a young child.[NOTE:4]",
